request.description:
Get all messages between two users with pagination.

**Response Example:**
```json
{
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg-uuid-1",
      "senderId": "user1_id",
      "receiverId": "user2_id",
      "content": "Hello!",
      "isRead": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-01-11T10:30:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 50,
    "total": 125,
    "totalPages": 3
  }
}
```

Get total unread message count for a user.

**Response Example:**
```json
{
  "userId": "user-uuid-123",
  "unreadCount": 12,
  "conversations": [
    {
      "senderId": "user2_id",
      "senderName": "John Doe",
      "unreadCount": 5
    },
    {
      "senderId": "user3_id",
      "senderName": "Jane Smith",
      "unreadCount": 7
    }
  ]
}
```
